Example JSON arguments:
{
  "databaseId": "UUID",
  "pageUid": "UUID"
}

Example JSON response:
{
  "status": "removed",
  "databaseId": "UUID",
  "pageUid": "UUID",
  "title": "Page Title"
}'
%

